  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Solar.Summary: LEMS is installing a solar mini-grid in Hanang District, Manyara Region and training mostly women in the use of off-grid solar/wind generated power. The expected impact is increased incomes for women as a result of using the power generated and connected to their business premises as well as usage of power to facilitate preservation of milk and vegetables so as to increase access to markets.</narrative>
  </description>
